<translate>
==== RequiresEquippedBothHands ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If the parameter is true, then the item must be held in both hands to use it.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
RequiresEquippedBothHands = TRUE,
</syntaxhighlight>
